OL,3,GNEWSAFirms to be charged for disruptive
OL,4,Aroadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme aimed at reducing traffic
OL,7,Fcongestion by charging firms thousands
OL,8,Fof pounds for causing disruption will
OL,9,Fcome into force next week.
OL,11,FThe lane rental scheme will come into
OL,12,Feffect across County Durham on Monday,
OL,13,Fmaking it the first local authority in
OL,14,Fthe North East and the first county
OL,15,Fauthority outside of the London area to
OL,16,Fdo so.
OL,18,FThe scheme will allow Durham County
OL,19,FCouncil to charge organisations for
OL,20,Fworks carried out on the county's
OL,21,Fbusiest routes and at times when they
OL,22,Fare most likely to cause disruption.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
